# The only variable that points this application at a Nivara Desk API.
# It configures the HTTP base, the real-time origin (this URL plus /rt), and the
# OpenAPI document types are generated from.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local, which is not committed. There is deliberately no
# committed default: the value below is the deployed API, and a default nobody
# chose is exactly what src/config/api.ts refuses to fall back to.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://nivara-api-nestjs.onrender.com
